% dup_stages_head: alternative heads hold their rule's name in another stage: refused.
catalog dup_stages_head 1.
provenance text "one space of names, across stages (spec/18 §4)" "2026-11-02".
layers (dyn).
stages (act settle).
namespace d produce (dyn).
pred p : d.
pred q : d.
stage act {
  %% It takes p one way or the other.
  turn [dyn] : p -o (q @w 0.5 | () @w 0.5).
}
stage settle {
  %% It takes q, under the name.
  turn [dyn] : q -o p.
}
#init p 1
#steps 2
